history.json: 9 rows from a real Omarchy 4.5 (omarchy-dev edge, Omapager)
history.json, chosen to cover each kind seen (app, low, critical, Chrome
web notification with a source anchor, omarchy-action with glyph and
timeout, omasnap with execArgv/execActions naming a screenshot, a crash
action). Keys, ids, times, apps, icons, urgencies, durations and close
reasons are as recorded; summaries, bodies, raw bodies, the web origin, home
paths, pids and hashes are replaced. live.json and quiet.json follow the
same format (live rows carry no closed_ts).
